 "notes": "The manuscript copying was completed in NS 835 by Bhavānīśaṅkara and Gaurīśaṅkara during the reign of Ṛddhinarasiṃha Malla of Patan. A later historical note added on fol. 30v records events of NS 837: the attack on Koṭibāhāra (Patan) by the people of Bhaktapur (khapvayāpiṃ), the death of Ṛddhinarasiṃha four days later, and the request by the subjects (prajā) to King Mahendrasiṃhadeva of Kathmandu to rule Patan (ñala).",
